{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>He who oppresses him</b> — who decreed poverty upon him, because the oppressor thinks that HaShem cannot save him from his hand." "<b>And honors Him</b> — honors HaShem, because it says, <i>theענק תעניק לו</i> (you shall surely give him a gift), therefore."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:51.331444776Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}